{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123894","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123894/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123894/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123894/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123894","id":5604996167,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABThV0Rw","number":123894,"title":"await tween.finished doesn't wait","user":{"login":"whirlin22","id":45559876,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTU5ODc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45559876?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22","html_url":"https://github.com/whirlin22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whirlin22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-27T18:03:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T18:42:18Z","closed_at":"2026-09-27T18:40:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in 4.7.1\n\n```\nextends CanvasLayer\n\n@onready var overlay = $ColorRect\n\t\nfunc fade_out(duration = 0.5):\n\tvar t = get_tree().create_tween()\n\tvar b4 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\n\tt.tween_property(overlay, \"color\", Color(0, 0, 0, 1), duration)  \n\tawait t.finished\n\tprints(\"out dur\", b4, Time.get_ticks_usec()-b4)\n\n\t\nfunc fade_in(duration = 0.5):\n\tvar t = get_tree().create_tween()\n\tvar b4 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\n\tt.tween_property(overlay, \"color\", Color(0, 0, 0, 0), duration)  \n\tawait t.finished\n\tprints(\"in dur\", b4, Time.get_ticks_usec()-b4)\n```\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nA CanvasLayer node named SceneTransition has a ColorRect of full_screen size.  If I instance it as scene_transition and call scene_transition.fade_out(), change the scene, and then scene_transition.fade_in(), I don't see anything because both Tweens fire at approximately the same time.  This indicates that the await Tween.finished line doesn't actually wait.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI reproduced it with \n\nawait get_tree().create_tween().tween_interval(0.5).finished \n\nwhich also doesn't wait\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[await.zip.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32707556/await.zip.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_i